 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K-MiyeV8h6QQ7kNvwEgj7vt&_nc_oc=AdqedvX_QvEHzb2t-xzkA22zgAtIjRdYobOmKXvK3MzkV9CuzoiNU0gYmYU4SFIhFRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMUkSexPf8HXpWs72UgkHKrOOvGXJpClvWdLa1zc_HXLg&oe=6ACBA8C1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o5lr_7gBTt4Q7kNvwFgOK8_&_nc_oc=AdrgfbmcX0CQZcbWfBASRKROMxAcEYFhoBs6sb_bkcP0pdHBkY7zqvrsq35hsTJNkzw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMtWWmQsJmaBUWEWVJ6E20A0hIAZo8dirThjK4yEf7Opg&oe=6ACBB626"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N7C11UO_pL0Q7kNvwE2nlTd&_nc_oc=AdptBftOslBLSFMhwnzrLf4aZY8a-p2C1C738c2NpXODcRwh2TmwxLalC7Bu_by8zbE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMzvH0SEtxSwcbEs3VuiJPvbG81HLsf5N8oYc9zRjq-yw&oe=6ACBC01C"}, {"fil